    {
      "id": "claim_818ac7e8f0814f41992f47dd0d14d56d",
      "statement": "The GUI consumes the status channel in _update_status(), registered as a 100 ms GLib timeout: it drains the queue until empty and applies only the latest item ('syncing' updates the status card and feeds RGB zone colors to the zone preview widget when previews are enabled; 'stopped' resets the card to connected, re-enables the sync button, and re-presents the window if it had minimized to tray; 'error' sets the disconnected card and the error text as subtitle). It then renders get_stats()['fps'] to one decimal.",
